                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3262" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3262/hovercard"&gt;V4&lt;/a&gt; preview. Since 4.0.127-alpha, mostly client-side caching: Clock eviction, the public &lt;code&gt;ClientCache&lt;/code&gt; view (&lt;code&gt;GetClientCache()&lt;/code&gt;), opt-in / opt-out modes and flags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5998637477" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3297" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3297/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3297"&gt;#3297&lt;/a&gt;), group-level cache configuration (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6058635141" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3304" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3304/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3304"&gt;#3304&lt;/a&gt;), and the &lt;code&gt;None&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;KeyspaceNotifications&lt;/code&gt; modes with &lt;code&gt;Default&lt;/code&gt; falling back to keyspace notifications (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6067305896" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3305" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3305/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3305"&gt;#3305&lt;/a&gt;); plus main merged in up to 2026-10-23 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text=